--> 00:59:42.100 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这些配方将用于本场比赛\n预计将采用两停策略\n\n961\n00:59:43.440 --> 00:59:46.320 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n第8站之后，赛程将密集展开\n\n962\n00:59:46.520 --> 00:59:51.080 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n5周4场大奖赛，决定世界冠军走向\n\n963\n00:59:51.280 --> 00:59:54.180 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n今年第8场大奖赛，从后往前看发车位\n\n964\n00:59:55.780 --> 00:59:59.456 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马丁处境艰难\n\n965\n00:59:59.540 --> 01:00:02.136 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n两车第21和第22，头哥重新在前\n","60":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n965\n00:59:59.540 --> 01:00:02.136 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n两车第21和第22，头哥重新在前\n\n966\n01:00:02.220 --> 01:00:06.380 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n浴皇大帝带来升级，但本周末一直不太可靠\n\n967\n01:00:06.480 --> 01:00:08.716 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n佩大师排在队友博塔斯之前\n\n968\n01:00:08.800 --> 01:00:13.440 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n继续两两排开\n威廉姆斯塞恩斯在队友二本前\n\n969\n01:00:15.040 --> 01:00:16.620 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n接下来是可乐瓶\n\n970\n01:00:17.040 --> 01:00:20.500 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n旁边是哈斯的奥康，发车位第15\n\n971\n01:00:21.300 --> 01:00:24.976 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n霍肯伯格第14，他曾在这里头排发车\n\n972\n01:00:25.060 --> 01:00:28.040 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n熊人代表美国车队排在第13\n\n973\n01:00:28.180 --> 01:00:31.240 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n接着是博托莱托，去年曾在这里拿分\n\n974\n01:00:31.460 --> 01:00:32.760 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他旁边是加大师\n\n975\n01:00:33.080 --> 01:00:36.580 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n加大师力争延续今年站站得分的纪录\n\n976\n01:00:36.780 --> 01:00:40.520 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n林皇和劳森本季第4次进入Q3\n\n977\n01:00:41.280 --> 01:00:43.980 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n第8位是哈加，皮亚第7\n\n978\n01:00:44.780 --> 01:00:47.980 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n去年他曾从第7位发车在此争胜\n\n979\n01:00:48.280 --> 01:00:49.676 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他去年的对手潘子排在第6\n\n980\n01:00:49.760 --> 01:00:51.960 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n潘子全力冲击杆位\n\n981\n01:00:52.420 --> 01:00:54.416 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n却在第9弯冲出赛道\n\n982\n01:00:54.500 --> 01:00:57.376 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\nKimi收油，以为是双黄旗\n\n983\n01:00:57.460 --> 01:01:00.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n其实只是单黄旗，老汉是最近冠军\n","61":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n983\n01:00:57.460 --> 01:01:00.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n其实只是单黄旗，老汉是最近冠军\n\n984\n01:01:00.720 --> 01:01:04.556 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n乐扣与皇帝并排发车\n这一胜对两人都意义重大\n\n985\n01:01:04.640 --> 01:01:07.400 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n皇帝是今天要击败的人\n\n986\n01:01:07.500 --> 01:01:10.140 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n本季第4个杆位\n\n987\n01:01:10.280 --> 01:01:14.960 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n生涯第11杆，奥地利站大战一触即发\n\n988\n01:01:15.080 --> 01:01:17.420 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n酷热仍在持续\n\n989\n01:01:17.820 --> 01:01:21.920 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n赛道温度48摄氏度，118华氏度\n\n990\n01:01:22.460 --> 01:01:25.480 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们也很期待这场比赛\n解说席上，我是亚历克斯·雅克\n\n991\n01:01:25.600 --> 01:01:29.660 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n身旁是2001年此站冠军\n大卫·库特哈德\n\n992\n01:01:29.940 --> 01:01:32.480 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n另一位是乔利恩·帕尔默\nDC，先请你说\n\n993\n01:01:33.020 --> 01:01:34.440 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这是一场胜负难料的比赛，对吧？\n\n994\n01:01:35.060 --> 01:01:36.160 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是啊，这不正是我们喜欢的吗？\n\n995\n01:01:36.320 --> 01:01:38.180 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n赛季初的形势令人难忘\n\n996\n01:01:38.740 --> 01:01:42.620 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n想想澳大利亚站，梅奔当时\n\n997\n01:01:42.980 --> 01:01:45.940 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看起来完全掌控局面，准备一骑绝尘\n\n998\n01:01:46.180 --> 01:01:48.400 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但F1从不静止\n\n999\n01:01:48.820 --> 01:01:53.320 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n窝法的反弹非常令人印象深刻\n\n1000\n01:01:53.720 --> 01:01:56.480 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n各队都在不断带来升级\n\n1001\n01:01:56.640 --> 01:02:00.516 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n而且三支不同车队都曾有望拿杆位\n","62":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n1001\n01:01:56.640 --> 01:02:00.516 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n而且三支不同车队都曾有望拿杆位\n\n1002\n01:02:00.600 --> 01:02:04.120 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n还不只是车手之间的较量\n\n1003\n01:02:04.260 --> 01:02:08.020 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n开局会像一场棋局\n\n1004\n01:02:08.500 --> 01:02:11.660 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n要看谁先在轮胎上撑不住\n\n1005\n01:02:12.320 --> 01:02:14.440 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n之后再看谁能把握机会\n\n1006\n01:02:14.560 --> 01:02:21.160 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n场上热得发烫，屏幕显示48度\n\n1007\n01:02:21.500 --> 01:02:26.636 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我在发车区时，一位倍耐力工程师\n给我看了温度计\n\n1008\n01:02:26.720 --> 01:02:32.780 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n显示51度，这是本周末最热的一天\n\n1009\n01:02:33.220 --> 01:02:36.360 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n上次西班牙站我说很有好戏的感觉\n\n1010\n01:02:36.780 --> 01:02:37.780 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n结果确实如此\n\n1011\n01:02:37.940 --> 01:02:40.060 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n今天同样有一场好戏的感觉\n\n1012\n01:02:40.200 --> 01:02:44.860 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n希望2026赛季F1再度不负期待\n\n1013\n01:02:44.980 --> 01:02:49.160 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n头排的皇帝与乐扣，都需要自我证明\n\n1014\n01:02:49.260 --> 01:02:52.636 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\nKimi第4起步\n\n1015\n01:02:52.720 --> 01:02:55.260 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n本周末他或许是全场最稳定、最快的\n\n1016\n01:02:55.360 --> 01:02:57.540 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n皇帝昨天在关键时刻完成了任务\n\n1017\n01:02:57.660 --> 01:03:00.376 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n也别忽略第3位的老汉\n","63":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n1017\n01:02:57.660 --> 01:03:00.376 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n也别忽略第3位的老汉\n\n1018\n01:03:00.460 --> 01:03:03.740 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n两辆窝法能否联手\n向梅奔施压\n\n1019\n01:03:04.100 --> 01:03:07.260 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我想胜负要到全程才能见分晓\n\n1020\n01:03:07.960 --> 01:03:14.976 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n前11名起步都用黄边胎\n也就是本站的中性胎\n\n1022\n01:03:15.060 --> 01:03:19.140 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n博托莱托选了抓地更强的软胎\n正驶离发车位\n\n1023\n01:03:19.380 --> 01:03:22.596 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这会让他起步更好\n但轮胎衰退也更快\n\n1024\n01:03:22.680 --> 01:03:26.436 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n大家正慢慢驶离发车位\n别太在意黄旗\n\n1025\n01:03:26.520 --> 01:03:31.520 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n没关系，有一辆车\n越过了Alpine\n\n1026\n01:03:31.720 --> 01:03:36.880 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n只要到最后一条安全车线前\n恢复正确顺序\n\n1027\n01:03:36.980 --> 01:03:40.440 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就能回到原定发车位置\n\n1028\n01:03:40.580 --> 01:03:44.476 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\nKimi目前积分优势很大\n今天至关重要\n\n1029\n01:03:44.560 --> 01:03:48.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但两支车队加入争夺时\n局势就会不同\n\n1030\n01:03:49.400 --> 01:03:51.900 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n积分涨跌也会更大\n\n1031\n01:03:52.060 --> 01:03:55.780 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他现在领先41分\n今天可能改写这一差距\n\n1032\n01:03:56.020 --> 01:03:59.236 align:middle l