--> 02:09:37.076 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n今年车手能更多压内侧路肩\n他们拆掉了\n\n2118\n02:09:37.160 --> 02:09:41.520 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n原本凸起的内侧路肩\n让车手能更好利用\n\n2119\n02:09:41.660 --> 02:09:43.260 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这是一次漂亮干净的超越\n\n2120\n02:09:45.520 --> 02:09:49.156 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n潘子中段继续留在场上\n似乎损失了太多时间\n\n2121\n02:09:49.240 --> 02:09:50.840 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n旧轮胎拖慢了他的节奏\n\n2122\n02:09:51.440 --> 02:09:55.580 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他落后10秒，轮胎新6圈\n还剩19圈\n\n2123\n02:09:55.840 --> 02:09:57.580 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\nVSC已启用\n\n2124\n02:09:58.120 --> 02:09:59.376 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n虚拟安全车状态确认\n\n2125\n02:09:59.460 --> 02:10:01.896 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n要是早一点发生\n局面可能会变\n","130":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n2125\n02:09:59.460 --> 02:10:01.896 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n要是早一点发生\n局面可能会变\n\n2126\n02:10:01.980 --> 02:10:05.360 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n第6小段赛道\n出现路面湿滑提示\n\n2127\n02:10:05.580 --> 02:10:08.680 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这里说的是微小段\n防撞柱也被撞飞了\n\n2128\n02:10:08.840 --> 02:10:11.760 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n工作人员上场处理\n所以需要启用VSC\n\n2129\n02:10:12.140 --> 02:10:14.000 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若出动完整安全车\n局面会改变吗？\n\n2130\n02:10:14.180 --> 02:10:16.956 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n那样Kimi和潘子\n\n2131\n02:10:17.040 --> 02:10:18.620 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n都会用新胎紧咬皇帝\n\n2132\n02:10:18.720 --> 02:10:21.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但VSC反而利好皇帝\n\n2133\n02:10:21.600 --> 02:10:25.340 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\nDC，你说他们从未像这样\n猛攻3号弯内侧？\n\n2134\n02:10:26.400 --> 02:10:30.616 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是