--> 01:29:07.120 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若有往年的地效和下压力\n\n1469\n01:29:07.240 --> 01:29:11.220 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n踩油门时能给赛车更多载荷\n\n1470\n01:29:11.800 --> 01:29:14.936 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看看轮胎使用情况\n装上新鼻翼的皮亚\n\n1471\n01:29:15.020 --> 01:29:17.660 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n和二本都已进站，两人都换上硬胎\n\n1472\n01:29:17.840 --> 01:29:23.376 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这给木瓜提供了重要参考\n皮亚上一圈1分35.1秒\n\n1473\n01:29:23.460 --> 01:29:27.240 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n其他人的圈速也在1分35秒上下\n\n1474\n01:29:27.740 --> 01:29:32.140 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n简单说，大家这时的圈速很接近\n\n1475\n01:29:32.780 --> 01:29:38.200 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n理想情况下，皮亚可以跑到终点\n或许能重新回到争夺\n\n1477\n01:29:38.320 --> 01:29:41.420 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但现实中硬胎真能撑那么久吗\n\n1478\n01:29:42.160 --> 01:29:45.796 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他还有大量工作要做\n\n1479\n01:29:45.880 --> 01:29:48.396 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n恐怕得靠安全车才有机会回到争夺\n\n1480\n01:29:48.480 --> 01:29:53.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n即便强队相对中游集团有速度优势\n\n1481\n01:29:53.720 --> 01:29:56.000 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n小红牛今天看起来相当稳健\n\n1482\n01:29:56.120 --> 01:29:57.696 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n博托莱托此刻也能跟住他们\n\n1483\n01:29:57.780 --> 01:30:01.840 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若皮亚能用硬胎跑到终点\n局面会好很多\n","32":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n1483\n01:29:57.780 --> 01:30:01.840 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若皮亚能用硬胎跑到终点\n局面会好很多\n\n1484\n01:30:01.980 --> 01:30:03.680 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但他已报告轮胎起粒\n\n1485\n01:30:04.360 --> 01:30:05.800 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n也许这是说给其他车队听的烟雾弹\n\n1486\n01:30:05.920 --> 01:30:09.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n木瓜在收集信息，他若说硬胎糟糕\n其他人就不会跟进\n\n1487\n01:30:10.460 --> 01:30:11.920 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n切到潘子的车载镜头\n\n1488\n01:30:13.080 --> 01:30:15.916 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n潘子前面就是皇帝\n\n1489\n01:30:16.000 --> 01:30:19.280 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n奥地利站也是这一幕\n他正一点点追近\n\n1490\n01:30:19.460 --> 01:30:21.060 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n一周前他还在争夺胜利\n\n1491\n01:30:21.880 --> 01:30:22.960 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n林皇正通过维修墙\n\n1492\n01:30:24.740 --> 01:30:27.020 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n要求劳森加快节奏\n\n1493\n01:30:27.400 --> 01:30:29.900 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这是林皇首次参加英国大奖赛\n\n1494\n01:30:30.320 --> 01:30:34.740 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他是首位出战英国站的英国少年\n\n1495\n01:30:34.980 --> 01:30:36.940 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n16圈前红灯熄灭时，他刚满18岁\n\n1496\n01:30:38.140 --> 01:30:42.040 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n通过维修墙给队友施加一点压力\n总是挺有意思\n\n1498\n01:30:43.020 --> 01:30:47.940 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n年龄上他确实年轻\n但赛车经历一点也不少\n\n1499\n01:30:48.420 --> 01:30:53.700 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他8岁就开始跑卡丁车\n很早就学会了所有赛场门道\n\n1501\n01:30:56.680 --> 01:30:59.060 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不过林皇非常沉着冷静\n\n9909005\n01:30:59.380 --> 01:31:02.003 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他上半年的表现很惊艳\n","33":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n9909005\n01:30:59.380 --> 01:31:02.003 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他上半年的表现很惊艳\n\n9909006\n01:31:02.003 --> 01:31:04.660 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n劳森也已收获大量积分\n\n1504\n01:31:05.380 --> 01:31:07.716 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n哈加在布鲁克兰兹弯越逼越近\n\n1505\n01:31:07.800 --> 01:31:11.140 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他还不够近，无法从内线杀入\n\n1506\n01:31:11.920 --> 01:31:16.200 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n迫使皇帝多耗能\n就像老汉防守Kimi时那样\n\n1507\n01:31:18.280 --> 01:31:22.236 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n皇帝眼下还在努力顶住压力\n\n1508\n01:31:22.320 --> 01:31:24.220 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n上一站胜利似乎重燃他的争冠希望\n\n1509\n01:31:24.700 --> 01:31:29.180 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n从周五一练起，他整个周末都在寻找赛车平衡\n\n1510\n01:31:30.040 --> 01:31:34.380 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这个问题延续到冲刺排位和冲刺赛\n\n1511\n01:31:34.900 --> 01:31:35.980 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n现在轮到潘子进攻\n\n1512\n01:31:36.840 --> 01:31:38.316 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他也看到了机会和希望\n\n1513\n01:31:38.400 --> 01:31:41.660 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看看他如何穿过\n马格特斯—贝克茨组合弯\n\n1514\n01:31:43.380 --> 01:31:44.900 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n漂亮，这就是答案\n\n1515\n01:31:45.560 --> 01:31:48.640 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n今年的赛车能更紧地跟住前车\n\n1516\n01:31:49.160 --> 01:31:50.600 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n整体下压力更低\n\n1517\n01:31:51.540 --> 01:31:52.740 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n地面效应不再像过去那样主导赛车\n\n1518\n01:31:53.700 --> 01:31:56.016 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这在许多情况下带来更精彩的比赛\n\n1519\n01:31:56.100 --> 01:31:59.056 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n赛车能贴着前车通过这类弯角\n\n1520\n01:31:59.140 --> 01:32:02.256 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n通常会有大量脏空气\n赛车会丢失空气动力平台\n","34":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n1520\n01:31:59.140 --> 01:32:02.256 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n通常会有大量脏空气\n赛车会丢失空气动力平台\n\n1521\n01:32:02.340 --> 01:32:07.976 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n高速弯中前轴或后轴就会开始滑动\n\n1522\n01:32:08.060 --> 01:32:11.080 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你想让赛车牢牢贴地，它却像在漂浮\n\n1523\n01:32:11.200 --> 01:32:13.876 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n潘子这圈并不差\n\n1524\n01:32:13.960 